{"unit_id":"ziz12138__dsh-lawcorpus#feature-1","repo":"ziz12138/dsh-lawcorpus","commit":"b26655d4aa921735775958811950c2af2aa558d2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lawcorpus 的功能「按主题找框架卡」：lawcorpus_frame 对题名、关键词和摘要进行 BM25 检索，返回论文框架卡，可按期刊、年份和体裁筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:412-425","lib/index.js:473-508","lib/store.js:156-168"]}
